-- GwangalliMindLines: the line banks of the NPC mind (owner: npc_mind). Pure data, no instances, no
-- Roblox globals (Lune / node unit tests load it directly). The composer is GwangalliMindShared.
--
-- FORMAT
--   G[intent][mood]          generic replies of every archetype
--   A[arch][intent][mood]    archetype voice (wins over G when present)
--   an entry is a list of lines (used in both registers) or { p = {...}, c = {...} }:
--     p = 존댓말 (strangers / formal people), c = 반말 (close, or people who talk down anyway)
--   mood: good | neutral | bad | angry | scared | lover | enemy  (+ "any" = every mood)
-- Lines are written in standard Korean; Busan speakers get GwangalliMindShared.dialect() on top.
-- PLACEHOLDERS (GwangalliMindShared.fill): {you} the player, {me} the NPC's name, {job} {age} {food}
--   {food2} {nofood} {gift} {hobby} {place} {time} {weather} {friend} {news} {area} {ago} {money}
--   {item} {kind} {answer} {other}
-- Every bank has many variants on purpose: the composer never repeats a line it said to this player
-- recently, adds a memory prefix / a context tail / a question back, and runs the archetype's voice.

